    {
      "id": "answer1",
      "type": "custom",
      "data": {
        "variables": [],
        "answer": "{{#llm1.text#}}\n\n---\n【API 状态码】POST={{#http_post.status_code#}} GET={{#http_get.status_code#}}\n【API 响应体】\n{{#http_post.body#}}\n{{#http_get.body#}}\n\n若状态码为 503，表示员工 JWT 未接入，不能算录入成功。",
        "type": "answer",
        "title": "直接回复"
